            "value" : "在图像中拖动某种颜色。相近的颜色族会一起移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a point. Click to add one. Double-click a point to remove it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动控制点。点击可添加，双击控制点可删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag inside the wheel. Angle sets hue, distance sets saturation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
