    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灯光亮到多少才产生光晕；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的光点才有"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灯光亮到多少才产生星芒；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的光点才有"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画面为纯黑时线条的亮度，使其在黑底上也可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灯光散开为光斑的亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某种颜色与被选颜色的最大差距仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各重影之间的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕线条之间的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个颜色通道（0–255）与单击颜色的最大差距仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锐化从各边缘延伸的距离，以像素为单位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整在亮度方向延伸的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整在色相方向延伸的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整在饱和度方向延伸的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失焦程度：每个光斑的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模糊柔和的程度，以像素为单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "亮度在推动线条前被平滑的程度，从尖锐脊线到圆润起伏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "颜色分离的距离，红蓝各向一侧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镜头镀膜使光斑沿长度偏蓝的程度；0 保留灯光原本的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线的扩散范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light wraps around the subject's edges" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线环绕主体边缘的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "星芒的延伸长度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the streaks reach across the picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光斑在画面中延伸的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fine the detail it sharpens: small for crisp texture, larger for a punchier look" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锐化的细节尺度：小值突出清晰纹理，大值更具冲击力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每帧显示的时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每道灯光的星芒数量，如同镜头光圈叶片形成的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画面重影的次数，每次更淡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线散射的程度：亮部周围形成柔和光晕，暗部被轻轻提亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个像素的误差扩散给邻域的比例。越小则平坦区域越多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明亮处线条填满间隙的比例；较暗处线条更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用配置文件畸变校正的比例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用配置文件暗角校正的比例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strongly edges and fine detail are brought out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边缘与细节的强化程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the light ends on the inside: low feathers it off softly from the edge, high holds it bright and ends it crisply" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线在内侧的收束方式：低值从边缘柔和羽化，高值保持明亮并干脆截断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线条两端及每段虚线、实点的收尾方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
